    "description": {
      "value": "You force the target to see a vision of its own death. It takes 8d6 mental damage with a Will save. If the target is reduced to 0 HP by this spell, its vision becomes reality and kills it instantly.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target takes half damage and is frightened 1.\n- **Failure:** The target takes full damage and is frightened 2.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target double damage, is frightened 4 and is fleeing for as long as it is frightened."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 2d6."
    },
